
>> blue := ['blue'].
>> colors := ସାରଣୀ ← ['yellow']; ['green']; blue ; ['red']; ['orange']; ['purple']; ['pink'].
>> palette := colors ଆରମ୍ଭ: 2 ଲମ୍ବ: 3.
ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: (palette ଯୋଡ଼: [',']), ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି. 
